{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0035","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=sad",{1,"Sheriff Dunn was up for election in November",2,"He'd have won",1,"Third term, he'd have won by a mile",2,"He'd have hated this, he never even liked the Army",3,"He never liked anybody who wasn't a cousin"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0036","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=sad",{1,"I didn't join to do this",2,"Nobody joined to do this",1,"I joined to direct traffic at the school and tell tourists where the bathrooms are",2,"That's the job, that's what I signed up for",1,"I miss telling people where the bathrooms are",3,"Behind the courthouse, to the left"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0037","shelter",2,"reg=law,swat|day=2,6|mood=sad",{1,"Longest I ever went without a call was four hours, on a Wednesday",2,"It's been three days",1,"I keep waiting for it to ring, for somebody to say Deputy, there's a cow in the road"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0038","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny",{1,"Evidence locker had a whole box of cigarettes",2,"Whose?",1,"Nobody's, from a case, they were never gonna be claimed",2,"Do you still have the key?",1,"Do I still have the key, what is wrong with you, of course I do",3,"Is the locker far"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0039","shelter",4,"reg=law,swat|hour=16,5|mood=grim",{1,"Been writing letters to people's families",2,"You can't mail them",1,"I know, I keep them in my vest, I figure someday",2,"How many have you got?",1,"Four, and I don't wanna do the fifth",3,"Don't do the fifth tonight..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0040","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny|world=building",{1,"I can sleep standing up, learned it at the academy",2,"That's a lie",1,"It's a skill, you lean on something and go limp",2,"Show me",1,"Hold on, I'm busy being awake",3,"I'll hold the wall"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0041","shelter",4,"reg=law,swat|day=1,13|mood=sad",{1,"Our K-9 is at the kennel",2,"Rex?",1,"Rex, I fed him Thursday, and I don't know, I just don't know",2,"He'll be fine",1,"He's a police dog, he'll be fine, he'll be the best-behaved dog in Kentucky",3,"He'll be eating the kennel door"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0042","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=sad",{1,"I know every back road in this county, every one of them",2,"That's why we're here",1,"And I'm still lost, I look at a road I've driven a thousand times and I don't know where it goes",3,"That's normal now"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0043","shelter",4,"reg=law,swat|mood=calm",{1,"Pass the water",2,"It's low",1,"Pass it anyway...",3,"Everybody gets a swallow, not a gulp",1,"I know what a swallow is, I'm a professional",4,"Then swallow professionally"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0044","shelter",4,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny",{1,"Nine months of training for a door",2,"Don't start",1,"Nine months of training and the door's open, there's no fucking door",2,"Call it a retirement",3,"A very early retirement"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0045","shelter",4,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny",{1,"Cap's snoring again",2,"It's a good snore, it means he's sleeping",1,"It's a terrible snore, it sounds like a duck being sat on by a bear",3,"Let the man sleep, he's earned a duck",4,"Somebody cover the duck"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0046","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|day=2,13|mood=sad",{1,"My shift partner was Ray, eleven years",2,"Where is he?",1,"He took the Brandenburg road Saturday to check on his mother",2,"Did he make it?",1,"I don't know, he's not on the net, and the net's not on",3,"He'll turn up..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0047","shelter",4,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny|world=building",{1,"We should clear the next room before we sleep in it",2,"We cleared it twice",1,"Clear it again",2,"It's a closet, there's a goddamn mop in it!",1,"A closet's a room, a mop's got hands",3,"Clear the mop"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0048","shelter",2,"reg=law,swat|mood=calm",{1,"Smokey hat's in the other bag, where the fuck's my other bag?",2,"You don't need the hat",1,"I need the hat",2,"It's a hat"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0049","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny",{1,"Seven years and I never fired my weapon off the range",2,"Lucky",1,"Now it's twice a day, and I hate it",2,"At least you hit what you aim at",1,"That's the part I don't like",3,"That's the part you'll get used to"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0050","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=grim",{1,"You think they've got a plan, the Guard, the Army?",2,"I think somebody's got a plan",1,"I think the plan is a map with a circle on it, and we're inside the circle",2,"Then we're in the plan",3,"That's the county in one sentence"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0051","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|day=1,13|mood=grim",{1,"I keep thinking I should've stayed on the road",2,"Which road?",1,"Dixie, Friday, when it started, there were people everywhere, I should've stayed",2,"You couldn't have stayed",1,"I know, I know I couldn't have",3,"Nobody could've..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0052","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=sad",{1,"I got a speeding ticket once",2,"You?",1,"Seventy in a fifty-five, from a trooper, he was a prick about it, wrote me for ninety",2,"And now you're a cop",1,"I bought him a coffee at the courthouse, years later, he didn't remember me",3,"That's a trooper for you..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0053","shelter",4,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny",{1,"Who's got first watch",2,"Not me",3,"Not me",4,"I had it last night",1,"Somebody's lying, and it's a very small room"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0054","shelter",3,"reg=military|mood=funny",{1,"What's on the menu?",2,"Beef stew, or the omelet",1,"The omelet's the one that looks like a fever dream and tastes like ass",2,"We call it the vomlette",1,"Beef stew it is",3,"Beef stew's the only one that doesn't fight back"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0055","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite",{1,"Remember trading crackers for jelly?",2,"What kind of jelly?",1,"Grape. It was always grape",2,"You'd ask for the cheese spread too, wouldn't you?",3,"Don't even pretend-trade with him. He'll swindle you"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0056","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"Heater's still warm",2,"Don't sit on it",1,"I wasn't gonna sit on it",2,"You were looking at it like a pillow",3,"Everybody looks at it like a pillow"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0057","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite",{1,"Pound cake, who opened the pound cake?",2,"Not me",3,"Not me",1,"It's gone, somebody's got crumbs on their lip, I'm not saying who",2,"Don't look at me, look at the new guy"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0058","shelter",4,"reg=military|mood=calm",{1,"Commo check",2,"Nothing but hiss",1,"Try the other freq",2,"Tried it, tried the other other one, tried yelling",1,"Yelling's not a freq",3,"It works on the Lieutenant"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0059","shelter",4,"reg=military,elite|day=3,13|mood=grim",{1,"Net's been dead since Sunday",2,"Dead or jammed?",1,"Jammed has a shape, this has no shape",2,"Then it's down",3,"Or somebody turned it off..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0060","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|day=2,6|mood=calm",{1,"Hold position until further fucking notice",2,"How long is further notice?",1,"The Sergeant didn't say",2,"It's been three days of further goddamn notice",3,"That's a lot of further"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0061","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"Where's the Lieutenant?",2,"At the CP",1,"There's no CP",2,"Then he's at the ghost of one",3,"The ghost's got a better view than us"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0062","shelter",3,"reg=military|mood=sad",{1,"Nobody fucking told me we'd be doing this shit",2,"Nobody told fuckin' anybody",3,"Nobody told the Sergeant, he's just better at not looking surprised"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0063","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite",{1,"If the Sergeant goes down, who's next?",2,"You",1,"Me?",2,"You're senior, by two weeks",1,"That's not a good enough reason to put me in charge of anything",3,"It's the Army, it's the only fucking reason"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0064","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|hour=16,5|mood=angry",{1,"Ever get stuck with a whole week of fire watch?",2,"Once",1,"I thought they couldn't do that two nights running",2,"They could if you were the only one there to argue",1,"Who gave you the week?",2,"The one who didn't show up",3,"That would've been the Lieutenant, the asshole"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0065","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad",{1,"My spouse is on post at Campbell",2,"That's an hour",1,"Hour and ten, if you don't stop, and I can't",2,"You'd go if you could",1,"I'd go if I could, that's my whole sentence",3,"Nobody here's stopping you, go"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0066","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"I'm from Georgia, I never saw so much corn in my life",2,"It's Kentucky, that's what it is",1,"Corn and bourbon and dogs",2,"That's about right",3,"And basketball"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0067","shelter",3,"reg=military|mood=fear",{1,"Six weeks in the Army, and then this",2,"You're doing fine",1,"I haven't done anything, I've stood where they told me",2,"That's most of it, standing where they tell you",3,"That's the Army, that's all of it, I'm not lying"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0068","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"At Benning I did pushups for sneezing",2,"That's true",1,"Drill sergeant would've had our asses for this shit",2,"He'd have had our asses and then he'd have had a plan",3,"And a clipboard"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0069","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad",{1,"I still find sand in my boots from Kuwait",2,"It's been two years",1,"I shake them out and some falls on the floor, every time, I don't know where it comes from",2,"The same place you do",3,"Mine's in my fucking ears"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0070","shelter",2,"reg=military,elite|day=1,8|mood=grim",{1,"Haven't had mail since Friday",2,"There's no mail",1,"I know there's no mail, I still look"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0071","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"I'm owed three weeks of fucking pay",2,"Who's gonna pay you?",1,"The finance office, when it opens",2,"Put it on a form",3,"Put it on three fucking forms"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0072","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"I was due to re-up in August",2,"Don't",1,"Why not?",2,"They'll make you do the paperwork, and the paperwork's the only fucking thing left that works",3,"Re-up, I'll be your witness, you dumb bastard"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0073","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"I spent my whole career training to fight Russians",2,"So did I",1,"And here we are in Kentucky, and not a Russian in sight",2,"I'd take the Russians",3,"I'd take the Russians, at least they'd be organized"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0074","shelter",3,"reg=military|day=2,6|mood=funny",{1,"Hurry up and wait",2,"We've been waiting three days",1,"We've hurried up for three days, nobody said what for",2,"That's the Army, start to finish",3,"Wait, it's finishing?"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0075","shelter",4,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"This is FUBAR",2,"It's SNAFU",1,"What's the difference?",2,"One's a situation, one's a state of being, I forget which",3,"It's FUBAR, I was there for the goddamn invention"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0076","shelter",2,"reg=military,elite|mood=calm",{1,"I'm not scared",2,"Your hands are shaking",1,"It's cold",2,"It's ninety degrees",1,"It's a different kind of cold"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0077","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"Breaking in these boots is a joke, they're from 1990 and they hate me",2,"They fit",1,"They fit like somebody else's feet",3,"Somebody else's feet had a better time, the lucky bastards"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0078","shelter",3,"reg=elite",{1,"Water",2,"Two liters",1,"Good",2,"Rotation",1,"Four on, four off, same as yesterday",3,"Copy"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0079","shelter",3,"reg=elite",{1,"Mag count",2,"Seven",3,"Eight",2,"Seven",3,"Seven, then"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0080","shelter",2,"reg=elite|mood=calm",{1,"Quiet",2,"Always quiet",1,"It wasn't earlier",2,"I know, I heard it too"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0081","shelter",2,"reg=elite",{1,"Sleep when you can",2,"I can't",1,"Then rest",2,"That I can do"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0082","shelter",2,"reg=elite|hour=4,9|mood=grim",{1,"Moving at first light",2,"Direction",1,"Not decided",2,"Decide before then"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0083","shelter",3,"reg=elite",{1,"Hands",2,"Fine...",1,"Show me",2,"...fine",1,"That's a lot of fine",3,"Let it go"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0084","shelter",4,"reg=elite|mood=calm",{1,"Anything",2,"No",3,"Negative",4,"Nothing",1,"That's a lot of nothing"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0085","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad",{1,"I'd give a month's pay for a cold Coke",2,"Which month",1,"Any, all of them, I never spent it anyway...",3,"Take mine too, I've got a lot of months"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0086","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"Somebody drew a mustache on the Lieutenant's photo, with a Sharpie, the sons of bitches",2,"Where's the photo?",1,"His wallet, he was showing the platoon his kid",3,"It's a very good mustache"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0087","shelter",2,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad",{1,"I counted our MREs, eleven",2,"Count again",1,"Counted again, ten",2,"Count a third time and you'll have none"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0088","shelter",3,"reg=military|mood=fear",{1,"I'm supposed to be on the range tomorrow",2,"There's no range",1,"I know, it's just, that's where I'm supposed to be, I've got a schedule",3,"Keep the schedule, it helps"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0089","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"Fort Knox taught me to drive a sixty-ton tank",2,"And?",1,"And not one damn thing about this!",3,"They don't make a field manual for this shit!"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0090","shelter",4,"reg=military,elite|mood=calm",{1,"Who's got dip?",2,"Skoal, wintergreen",1,"I'll trade you a pack of gum",3,"Spit in a can, not on the goddamn floor",1,"It's a floor, it's already got everything on it",4,"That's not a reason"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0091","shelter",3,"reg=military|mood=funny|world=hot",{1,"Airborne",2,"All the way",1,"I've been waiting to say that for two days",2,"I'm not saying it, it's too hot to yell",3,"Airborne, all the way, shut up"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0092","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"My first jump, I closed my eyes the whole way down",2,"Everybody does",1,"The sergeant said open them or break your legs, I opened them",2,"Good decision",3,"I opened mine at the last second, it was a good surprise"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0093","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad",{1,"Mama's gonna kill me, I haven't called in a month",2,"There's no phones",1,"I know, I'm saying when this is over she's gonna kill me",2,"When it's over she'll be too happy to kill you",3,"She'll kill you after..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0094","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"Ranger school, I ate a rat",2,"You did not",1,"It was a very small rat and a man was watching",2,"Did it taste like chicken?",1,"It tasted like rat, with hope",3,"Everything tastes like chicken with enough hope and a lot of salt"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0095","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=grim",{1,"Count the rounds, then count them again",2,"Done",3,"I'll count them a third time",2,"Why?",3,"Because the number keeps changing..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0096","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad",{1,"Lieutenant's not sleeping",2,"I know",1,"He sits up with the map every night",3,"He's got nothing on that map, it's an old county road map from a gas station",1,"That's what I'm saying"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0097","shelter",3,"reg=military|mood=funny",{1,"New guy",2,"It's been three weeks",1,"Still the new guy",2,"Until somebody newer shows up",1,"And who's gonna show up?",3,"Fine, I take it back"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0098","shelter",4,"reg=military,elite|mood=calm|world=door",{1,"Take the corner seat, you can see both doors",2,"I like the corner",1,"Everybody likes the corner, that's why it's a good corner",3,"Take turns",4,"I'll take the other corner"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0099","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=calm",{1,"Boots off, feet up, you're no good to me with blisters",2,"I'm fine",1,"Boots off, that's an order",2,"From who?",1,"From me, I'm the oldest",3,"It's a good order, take 'em off"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0100","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad",{1,"What's the first thing you do when you get home?",2,"Home?",1,"After all this, when the Army says we can go",2,"Sleep, in my own bed, with the window open and a fan going",1,"Yeah",3,"And a glass of tea so cold it hurts your teeth"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0101","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=calm",{1,"I thought it'd be louder",2,"What",1,"The end of things, I thought there'd be more noise",2,"There was noise, in the beginning",1,"I mean now, it's just quiet and hot",3,"It's the quiet that gets you"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0102","shelter",4,"reg=elite|world=door",{1,"Check the door",2,"Checked",1,"Check it again",2,"Checked again",1,"Good",3,"Door's fine"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0103","shelter",4,"reg=elite",{1,"Shift change",2,"Two minutes",1,"I'll take the post",2,"Copy",3,"Don't fall asleep"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0104","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=grim",{1,"Rations",2,"Four days",1,"If we stretch",2,"Five, six if somebody doesn't eat",3,"Everybody eats..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0105","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad|world=hot",{1,"You write home?",2,"Every night",1,"What do you put?",2,"Weather, mostly, it's hot, it's still hot",1,"That's what I put too",3,"Nobody's reading it, but we write it"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0106","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"I miss chow hall pizza",2,"Nobody misses chow hall pizza",1,"I'd eat a whole pan, cold, on the floor of the latrine",2,"Okay, that one I believe",3,"I'd eat the pan"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0107","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad",{1,"You ever been this far from base?",2,"Never",1,"It's thirty miles",2,"Thirty miles feels like thirty hundred",3,"It's the longest thirty miles in the world"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0108","shelter",3,"reg=military,elite|mood=sad",{1,"My hands haven't stopped shaking since the last one",2,"Let me see",1,"Don't, it'll make it worse",2,"It's okay, I'm just looking",3,"It's the cold, ha",1,"There's no cold..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0109","shelter",4,"reg=military,elite|mood=funny",{1,"Somebody's snoring on watch",2,"It's not me",3,"It's not me",4,"It's me, and I'm not sorry",1,"Wake up and be sorry"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0110","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=sad",{1,"Nineteen years a cop and I never once drew on anybody, and now I'm doing it twice a day",2,"You're good at it",1,"That's the part that scares me, I'm getting good at it",3,"Somebody has to be..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0111","shelter",2,"reg=law,swat|day=1,13|mood=sad",{1,"The Sheriff's wife called the station Friday, crying, and I put her on hold",2,"You didn't know",1,"I put her on hold to take a call about a barking dog, a goddamn dog"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0112","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|day=6,10|mood=angry",{1,"Where the hell is the National Guard?",2,"They're coming",1,"Coming from where, Frankfort? Frankfort's a two-hour drive!",3,"It's been a week, they could've walked"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0113","shelter",2,"reg=law,swat|mood=grim",{1,"I gave a woman a flare and told her to stay with her car",2,"And?",1,"And I left, I had a call, I left her there",2,"You couldn't have known..."}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0114","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=sad",{1,"We're supposed to protect and serve, and I'm sitting in somebody's basement counting crackers",2,"It's a lot of crackers",1,"It's seventeen crackers, I counted",3,"Seventeen's good, hold onto them"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0115","shelter",2,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny",{1,"My badge feels heavy, like somebody put a brick behind it",2,"That's the bullet-resistant vest",1,"No, I mean the badge, specifically"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0116","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=sad",{1,"All I wanted was one normal Saturday night, a drunk, a fight, a guy who forgot where he parked",2,"That sounds like heaven",1,"I'd pull over a thousand drunks for one normal Saturday",3,"I'd arrest every one of them personally"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0117","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat",{1,"If the Sheriff told me to hold the line I'd hold it, but there's no line",2,"Then hold your spot",1,"My spot's a chair with a lean",3,"It's a good lean, it's historic"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0118","shelter",2,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny",{1,"I'm so tired I put my coffee in my pocket and tried to drink my radio",2,"You did not",1,"I held it up to my mouth and almost said ten-four to a cup"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0119","shelter",3,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny",{1,"I used to hate the night shift",2,"You didn't hate it, you were scared of it",1,"I hated it, and I'd give a lot for it right now",3,"It's just a longer night"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0120","shelter",2,"reg=law,swat|mood=angry",{1,"I hate being in charge, I hate every second of it, nobody ever teaches you how",2,"You're doing fine",1,"I'm doing something, I'll give you that, but it's sure as hell not fine"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0121","shelter",4,"reg=law,swat|mood=funny",{1,"Anybody got a pen that works",2,"I've got a pen",3,"I've got a pencil",4,"I've got a crayon",1,"Where did you get a crayon",4,"It's a long story"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0122","shelter",2,"reg=law,swat|mood=sad",{1,"The first thing they teach you is don't take it personally",2,"And?",1,"And I took every second of it personally, and I'd do it again"}},
