{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0126","shelter",2,"reg=law,swat|mood=calm",{1,"I never liked the jail, you know",2,"Nobody likes the jail",1,"The noise, mostly, the doors, I'd lie awake and hear the doors",2,"And now it's quiet",1,"And now I can't sleep"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0127","shelter",3,"reg=military|mood=angry",{1,"Fuck the Army, fuck the line, fuck all of it!",2,"You done?",1,"Almost, give me a minute",3,"Take your time, I'm gonna sit here and agree with every word"}},
{"fw_ld6_shelter_lawmil_1_0128","shelter",2,"reg=military|mood=grim",{1,"My CO told us hold the line, and then there was no line, and then there was no CO",2,"I know",1,"I'm still holding it, it's a spot on the floor, I'm very loyal"}},
